  "proof": [
    "The existing N01ControlledRootInputAtState provides the actual same flow, global inverse regularity, period, positive odd root value and its first CSBound. The CSBound is used only to choose the genuine state-dependent N03 identification band.",
    "The actual raw coefficient strip at the root proves the same radial factor smooth and positive. Composition by the displayed scale proves the scaled factor regularity; no derivative bound or inverse-scale numerical cost is taken from this composition.",
    "The existing unit-identification theorem then gives exact ordinary jets of the original stored chart and every real power of its positive height. Actual closed-root membership and positivity come from the supplied original PartA/PartB.",
    "The theorem selects the same flow from its supplied actual input certificate and keeps D/T/S/C/E/L/K. No new target jet estimate or uniform material bound is an input."
  ],
  "scope_caveat": "This is a qualitative identification adapter for the actual existing input certificate. The next material theorem must choose that certificate from the existing N01 constructor; this adapter alone is not a final primitive or material estimate.",
